V-I pX in patients with HTLV-I associated neurological disease</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1990</year><volume>348</volume><fpage>245</fpage><lpage>248</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2146511</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/348245a0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kannagi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sugamura</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinoshita</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Uchino</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hinuma</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Specific cytolysis of fresh tumor cells by an autologous killer T cell line derived from an adult T cell leukemia/lymphoma patient</article-title><source>J Immunol</source><year>1984</year><volume>133</volume><fpage>1037</fpage><lpage>1041</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6203964</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kannagi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sugamura</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Sato</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Okochi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Uchino</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hinuma</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Establishment of human cytotoxic T cell lines specific for human adult T cell leukemia virus-bearing cells</article-title><source>J Immunol</source><year>1983</year><volume>130</volume><fpage>2942</fpage><lpage>2946</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6189906</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Parker</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></nam